WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.460
Hello everybody, my name is Marikplier, and welcome to Don't Take The Risk

00:00:03.560 --> 00:00:05.260
Now I wanna warn you guys

00:00:06.040 --> 00:00:09.480
This game is going to be very dark and very serious

00:00:09.480 --> 00:00:13.200
It involves you getting a call from a wrong number

00:00:13.320 --> 00:00:19.020
but the person on the other line is trying to find a suicide prevention hotline, so

00:00:19.460 --> 00:00:23.660
this game covers very serious subject matters

00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:26.880
and I want you guys to know that before going into it because

00:00:27.180 --> 00:00:32.560
It, in all honesty, this game is probably not going to be what you would call "fun"

00:00:33.240 --> 00:00:36.840
